    <briefdescription>
<para>Equality/inequality operators for domaintypes. <linebreak/>
 </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><linebreak/>
The module provides public operators to check for equality/inequality of domaintypes, e.g:<linebreak/>
 <verbatim>       type(domain1D) :: a, b
       type(domain2D) :: c, d
       ...
       if( a.NE.b )then
       ...
       end if
       if( c==d )then
       ...
       end if
</verbatim> <linebreak/>
 Domains are considered equal if and only if the start and end indices of each of their component global, data and compute domains are equal. </para>    </detaileddescription>
